            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Twiddle 0.6

- Restores Twiddle to the menu bar when you reopen the app after dragging its icon out.
- Shows a Restore Icon action in Settings whenever the menu-bar item is unavailable.
- Uses the Twiddle orange for both filter directions and removes filter-color customization.
]]></description>
